span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">저소득&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">소상공인 가정의 대학생</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">으로 아래 항목을&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">모두 충족</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">해야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></p><table style=\"width: 1165px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 82.5pt; height: 18.75pt; border-width: 0.28pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">구분</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 354pt; height: 18.75pt; border-width: 0.28pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">세부내용</span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 82.5pt; height: 52.5pt; border-width: 0.28pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">기본자격</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 354pt; height: 52.5pt; border-width: 0.28pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">년 소득금액증명 금액